{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，伯恩斯坦在最新報告中指出，SpaceX在11月14日舉行的星艦第15次試飛中，首次成功利用發射塔機械臂回收火箭上面級，標誌着其完全可重複使用運載系統取得關鍵技術突破。該機構認為，SpaceX在火箭回收及重複使用技術方面已領先其他競爭對手約十年，並重申對其股票的「跑贏大盤」評級。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587598.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.787728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:10:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_hash":"5d3183aa3385b470728680e80d9576f286d8f7854a47172544aea7eb9bffeafd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}